# ============================================================================
# HI02H11_L02_S04 — «मात्राओं की रेल» (ओ / औ)
# ============================================================================

# ---- SECRETS — never commit ------------------------------------------------
# 3_BUILD/.env (and _DRAFT_ORIGINAL/3_BUILD/.env) hold a live Gemini API key. A key that reaches a remote
# is compromised even if the commit is later removed, because it stays in the
# history and in every clone and fork. If one is ever pushed, ROTATE IT — do not
# try to scrub the history instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ---- generated review artefacts --------------------------------------------
# Regenerated from the build by 1_SPEC/_capture_settled.py; large and churny.
# Drop this line if you want the review captures in the repo for the SME.
_review_shots/
_audition/
_quarantine/
_build_report.json

# ---- Vercel CLI ------------------------------------------------------------
# `vercel link` / `vercel deploy` create .vercel/ with this machine's project and org ids.
# It is local state, not configuration: vercel.json and .vercelignore are the files to commit.
.vercel/

# ---- build + tooling noise -------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- local dist / packaging ------------------------------------------------
dist/
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ---- backups and scratch ---------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.bak.py
*.orig
*.rej
card.pre_revise.json
*.pre_revise.*
scratch/
tmp/

# ---- OS + editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
*~
# Office lock files - created while a .pptx / .xlsx / .docx is open
~$*

# ============================================================================
# DELIBERATELY TRACKED — do not add these to the list above
# ============================================================================
# 3_BUILD/HI02H11_L02_S04.html          is generated, but it IS the deliverable
#   and the only thing that runs on a device, so it is committed.
# 3_BUILD/card.json                     is generated, and the builder diffs the
#   PREVIOUS card against the new one to decide which voice clips went stale.
#   Untrack it and that stale-clip detection silently stops working — which is
#   how round-2 audio once shipped under round-3 text.
# 3_BUILD/assets/**                     the art and voice-over ARE the lesson.
# 4_ENGINE/lesson_template.html         generated by inject_train.py, but it is
#   what the builder stamps the card into; keep it so a clone can build.
# vercel.json + .vercelignore              the deployment config.
